OL,3,GNEWSAPeople with stomas challenge myths
OL,4,Aabout active lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor many people the prospect of living
OL,7,Fwith a stoma can seem daunting.
OL,9,FConcerns about appearance,
OL,10,Frelationships, travel and exercise are
OL,11,Fcommon, while misconceptions persist
OL,12,Fabout everything from odour to whether
OL,13,Fa stoma limits an active lifestyle.
OL,15,FBut people across the West of England
OL,16,Fare challenging those assumptions and
OL,17,Fshowing that surgery does not have to
OL,18,Fstop them doing the things they love.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
