OL,3,GNEWSAPeople with stomas challenge myths
OL,4,Aabout active lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Robbins, 54, an NHS service
OL,7,Fassistant from Somerset, said her stoma
OL,8,Fhad given her a new lease of life.
OL,9,FAfter years of living with
OL,10,Fdiverticulitis, she became so ill that
OL,11,Fshe feared for her future.
